                                                                                
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*                                                                      *        
*  SYSTEM     :  W512                                                  *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FÖRFATTARE :  BARSHARANI BISHOYE                                    *        
*                                                                      *        
*  INFILER    :  W512.W512M3.W51229                                    *        
*                                                                      *        
*  UTDATA     :  EXCELFIL W51230                                       *        
*                                                                      *        
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
                                                                                
FILE W51230D1                                                                   
%W51229  'IN-'                                                                  
                                                                                
*---------------------------------------------*                                 
*TEMPFIL FÖR SORTADE ARTIKELFILER             *                                 
*---------------------------------------------*                                 
FILE TPFIL1 FB(55 0)                                                            
%W51229  'T1-'                                                                  
                                                                                
*---------------------------------------------*                                 
* TEMPFIL MED DIVERSE LISTTRANSAR, EJ SUMMERADE                                 
*---------------------------------------------*                                 
FILE TPFIL2 FB(24 0)                                                            
T2-AREA            1 24 A                                                       
T2-IDDC-REC        1  2 A                                                       
T2-SUNETT          3 10 P 2                                                     
T2-KDTRADP        13  4 A                                                       
T2-KDPRODSL       17  3 A                                                       
T2-KDEKNIVA       20  4 A                                                       
                                                                                
****** EXCELENS UTFIL                                                           
FILE W51230D2 PRINTER VB(60  0)                                                 
                                                                                
****** EXCELENS 2:A TOM X:TE RAD                                                
UT-IDDC          W   2  A                                                       
UT-KDPRODSL      W   3  A                                                       
UT-KDTRADP       W   4  A                                                       
UT-TEXT          W  30  A                                                       
UT-SUMMA-N       W  11  N                                                       
UT-SUMMA-D       W   2  N                                                       
                                                                                
****** EXCELENS DETAILED UTFIL                                                  
FILE W51230D3 PRINTER VB(127  0)                                                
                                                                                
UT1-IDDC-REC     W   2  A                                                       
UT1-IDVERGL      W  10  A                                                       
UT1-DAVERDAT     W  16  N                                                       
UT1-KDEKHHT      W   3  A                                                       
UT1-KDEKSHT      W   3  A                                                       
UT1-KDEKNIVA     W   5  A                                                       
UT1-SUNTO-N      W  13  N                                                       
UT1-SUNTO-D      W   2  N                                                       
UT1-KDVALISO     W   3  A                                                       
UT1-IDDC-SEND    W   2  A                                                       
                                                                                
****** EXCELENS FÖRSTA RAD                                                      
RUB-DATUM        W   6  N                                                       
RUB-MÅNAD        W   2  N                                                       
                                                                                
%WDATKORT                                                                       
                                                                                
*-------------*                                                                 
* ARBETSAREOR *                                                                 
*-------------*                                                                 
W-PREV-KDTRADP   W   4  A                                                       
W-IDDC           W   2  A                                                       
W-KDPRODSL       W   3  A                                                       
W-KDTRADP        W   4  A                                                       
W-SUNETT         W   8  P  2  MASK ('ZZZZZZZZZZZ99.99-')                        
W-KVANTAL        W   5  P  0                                                    
IX               W   2  P  0                                                    
W-SEM            W   1  A    VALUE ';'                                          
W-DECIMAL        W   1  A    VALUE '.'                                          
                                                                                
W-SUNETT-FMT                     W  13  N 2                                     
W-SUNETT-N       W-SUNETT-FMT       11  N                                       
W-SUNETT-D       W-SUNETT-FMT   +11  2  N                                       
                                                                                
W-SUNTO-TOT                      W  13  N 2                                     
W-SUNTO-TOT-N    W-SUNTO-TOT        11  N                                       
W-SUNTO-TOT-D    W-SUNTO-TOT    +11  2  N                                       
                                                                                
PROGRAM-NAMN     W   6   A  VALUE 'W51230'                                      
DATUMKORT-ID     W   6   A  VALUE 'WDATUM'                                      
                                                                                
W-AAMMDD         W   6   N                                                      
W-AA   W-AAMMDD      2   N                                                      
W-MM   W-AAMMDD  +2  2   N                                                      
W-DD   W-AAMMDD  +4  2   N                                                      
                                                                                
BEPRODSL                W 27  A    OCCURS 38                                    
BEPRODSL-PS  BEPRODSL      2  A                                                 
BEPRODSL-TXT BEPRODSL +3  24  A                                                 
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*---------------------------------------------------------------*               
* STEG 1.SORTERA  ARTIKELSALDOPOSTER ALLA DC PER ARTIKELNUMMER  *               
*---------------------------------------------------------------*               
SORT W51230D1 TO TPFIL1 USING(IN-IDDC-REC)  SIZE 900000                         
                                                                                
JOB INPUT (TPFIL1 KEY (T1-IDDC-REC))  START A-INIT                              
                                                                                
  T2-IDDC-REC   = T1-IDDC-REC                                                   
  T2-SUNETT     = T1-SUNTO-TOT                                                  
  T2-KDTRADP    = T1-KDTRADP                                                    
  T2-KDPRODSL   = '90S'                                                         
  T2-KDEKNIVA   = T1-KDEKNIVA                                                   
  IF T2-SUNETT NE 0 AND                     +                                   
     T2-KDEKNIVA NE 'SUM'                                                       
    PUT TPFIL2                                                                  
  END-IF                                                                        
                                                                                
A-INIT. PROC                                                                    
  CALL DATKORT USING (PROGRAM-NAMN DATUMKORT-ID DATUMKORT)                      
  W-AA       = D-AAR                                                            
  W-MM       = D-MAANAD                                                         
  W-DD       = D-DAG                                                            
  RUB-DATUM  = W-AAMMDD                                                         
  RUB-MÅNAD  = W-MM                                                             
                                                                                
END-PROC                                                                        
                                                                                
*--------------------------------------------------------*                      
* STEG 2 SORTERA TPFIL2 TILL TPFIL2 PER DC OCH PRODSL                           
*        OCH SUMMERA SAMT SKRIV EXCELFIL                                        
*--------------------------------------------------------*                      
                                                                                
SORT TPFIL2 TO TPFIL2 USING (T2-KDTRADP T2-IDDC-REC T2-KDPRODSL)  +             
                             SIZE 200000                                        
JOB INPUT NULL                                                                  
                                                                                
  GET TPFIL2                                                                    
  IF NOT EOF TPFIL2                                                             
    W-IDDC             = T2-IDDC-REC                                            
    W-KDPRODSL         = T2-KDPRODSL                                            
    W-KDTRADP          = T2-KDTRADP                                             
    W-SUNETT           = 0                                                      
    DO WHILE NOT EOF TPFIL2                                                     
      IF T2-IDDC-REC = W-IDDC AND T2-KDPRODSL = W-KDPRODSL +                    
      AND T2-KDTRADP = W-KDTRADP                                                
        W-SUNETT = W-SUNETT + T2-SUNETT                                         
      ELSE                                                                      
        PERFORM SKRIV-EXCELPOST                                                 
        PRINT REPORT01                                                          
        W-IDDC             = T2-IDDC-REC                                        
        W-KDPRODSL         = T2-KDPRODSL                                        
        W-KDTRADP          = T2-KDTRADP                                         
        W-SUNETT           = T2-SUNETT                                          
      END-IF                                                                    
      GET TPFIL2                                                                
    END-DO                                                                      
  END-IF                                                                        
  PERFORM SKRIV-EXCELPOST                                                       
    IF W-KDTRADP NE ' '                                                         
      PRINT REPORT01                                                            
    END-IF                                                                      
                                                                                
  STOP                                                                          
                                                                                
SKRIV-EXCELPOST. PROC                                                           
  UT-IDDC       = W-IDDC                                                        
  UT-KDPRODSL   = W-KDPRODSL                                                    
  UT-KDTRADP    = W-KDTRADP                                                     
  UT-TEXT       = 'SURCHAGES'                                                   
  IX = 1                                                                        
  DO WHILE IX LE 98                                                             
    IF BEPRODSL-PS(IX) EQ UT-KDPRODSL                                           
      UT-TEXT     = BEPRODSL-TXT(IX)                                            
      IX = 99                                                                   
    END-IF                                                                      
    IX = IX + 1                                                                 
  END-DO                                                                        
  W-SUNETT-FMT  = W-SUNETT                                                      
  UT-SUMMA-N    = W-SUNETT-N                                                    
  UT-SUMMA-D    = W-SUNETT-D                                                    
END-PROC                                                                        
************************************************************************        
*** LIST FOR NON VCC - SENT TO D&P                                              
************************************************************************        
  REPORT   REPORT01             +                                               
           PRINTER W51230D2     +                                               
           LINESIZE 55          +                                               
           SPACE 0              +                                               
           NOHEADING            +                                               
           NOSPREAD             +                                               
           NOADJUST             +                                               
           PAGESIZE 32767       +                                               
           NODATE                                                               
LINE  1    UT-IDDC              +                                               
           W-SEM                +                                               
           UT-KDPRODSL          +                                               
           W-SEM                +                                               
           UT-TEXT              +                                               
           W-SEM                +                                               
           UT-SUMMA-N           +                                               
           W-DECIMAL            +                                               
           UT-SUMMA-D           +                                               
           W-SEM                                                                
*                                                                               
BEFORE-LINE. PROC                                                               
 IF W-KDTRADP NE W-PREV-KDTRADP                                                 
   DISPLAY '¤DAPW51230-001'                                                     
   DISPLAY '¤DAP' W-KDTRADP                                                     
   DISPLAY 'DATE' RUB-DATUM ';PERIOD' RUB-MÅNAD ';'                             
   W-PREV-KDTRADP = W-KDTRADP                                                   
 END-IF                                                                         
END-PROC                                                                        
*--------------------------------------------------------*                      
* STEG 3 SORT INPUT FILE ON DC                                                  
*--------------------------------------------------------*                      
SORT W51230D1 TO W51230D1 USING(IN-KDTRADP IN-IDDC-REC)  SIZE 900000            
JOB INPUT (W51230D1 KEY(IN-IDDC-REC))  START A-INIT1                            
                                                                                
   W-KDTRADP        =  IN-KDTRADP                                               
   UT1-IDDC-REC     =  IN-IDDC-REC                                              
   UT1-IDVERGL      =  IN-IDVERGL                                               
   UT1-DAVERDAT     =  IN-DAINLEV                                               
   UT1-KDEKHHT      =  IN-KDEKHHT                                               
   UT1-KDEKSHT      =  IN-KDEKSHT                                               
   UT1-KDEKNIVA     =  IN-KDEKNIVA                                              
   UT1-KDVALISO     =  IN-KDVALISO                                              
   UT1-IDDC-SEND    =  IN-IDDC-SEND                                             
                                                                                
   W-SUNTO-TOT   =  IN-SUNTO-TOT                                                
   UT1-SUNTO-N   =  W-SUNTO-TOT-N                                               
   UT1-SUNTO-D   =  W-SUNTO-TOT-D                                               
                                                                                
   IF UT1-KDEKNIVA  =  'SUM'                                                    
     CONTINUE                                                                   
   ELSE                                                                         
     PRINT REPORT02                                                             
   END-IF                                                                       
                                                                                
A-INIT1. PROC                                                                   
  W-SUNETT  =  0                                                                
  W-PREV-KDTRADP = '    '                                                       
  W-SUNETT-FMT   = 0                                                            
END-PROC                                                                        
************************************************************************        
*** LIST FOR NON VCC - SENT TO D&P - DETAILED REPORT                            
************************************************************************        
  REPORT   REPORT02             +                                               
           PRINTER W51230D3     +                                               
           LINESIZE 120         +                                               
           SPACE 0              +                                               
           NOHEADING            +                                               
           NOSPREAD             +                                               
           NOADJUST             +                                               
           PAGESIZE 32767       +                                               
           NODATE                                                               
LINE  1  UT1-IDDC-REC           +                                               
         W-SEM                  +                                               
         UT1-IDVERGL            +                                               
         W-SEM                  +                                               
         UT1-DAVERDAT           +                                               
         W-SEM                  +                                               
         UT1-KDEKHHT            +                                               
         W-SEM                  +                                               
         UT1-KDEKSHT            +                                               
         W-SEM                  +                                               
         UT1-KDEKNIVA           +                                               
         W-SEM                  +                                               
         UT1-SUNTO-N            +                                               
         W-DECIMAL              +                                               
         UT1-SUNTO-D            +                                               
         W-SEM                  +                                               
         UT1-KDVALISO           +                                               
         W-SEM                  +                                               
         UT1-IDDC-SEND          +                                               
         W-SEM                                                                  
*                                                                               
BEFORE-LINE. PROC                                                               
 IF W-KDTRADP NE W-PREV-KDTRADP                                                 
   DISPLAY '¤DAPW51230-002'                                                     
   DISPLAY '¤DAP' W-KDTRADP                                                     
   DISPLAY 'RECEIVING DC;VERIFICATION;DATE;EVENT;SUB EVENT; '          +        
           'EVENT LEVEL;SUM VALUE;CURRENCY CODE;SENDING DC;'                    
   W-PREV-KDTRADP  = W-KDTRADP                                                  
 END-IF                                                                         
END-PROC                                                                        
